### 좌석 홀딩 (seatId는 위 응답에서 확인)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/hold
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {최신_accessToken}

{
  "eventId": 2,
  "seatId": 1
}

### 같은 좌석 다시 홀딩 시도 (409 예상 - 이미 HOLDING 상태)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/hold
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxIiwicm9sZSI6IlVTRVIiLCJpYXQiOjE3ODYxNTUwMDcsImV4cCI6MTc4NjE1NjgwN30.5P19EkVPLSiUcoyR7WkX2CZNOfr-ngl329RZrL7VABigSpVVTgyhDjooBzqyLykb

